    @* #488 · THE VALVE BOARD — a damage-control mimic, the Battlestar Galactica shape. The ship drawn as
       her own compartments, each one a switch: shut the door, read for life, blow the room. It lives aft in
       ENGINEERING because the bridge panel is dead, so you walk toward the thing to reach the tool that
       kills it. The sensor cannot tell a survivor from the infestation — that is the whole decision. *@
    @if (_showVentPanel && _wreck is { } ventWreck)
